LOK: Impress reads every slide as a show plays it

.uno:SlideShow lists each slide: hidden, notes as text, the transition
and effects in the .uno:SlideTransition and .uno:SlideAnimations shapes,
and its media with frames. .uno:SlideMedia entries carry their frame,
x, y, width and height in 1/100 mm.

